# Rabid Gnaw: Bot1's Ornithopter (0/2) gets +1/+0 and then deals damage equal to its power - 1, not 0 - to Bot2's Llanowar Elves (1/1), which dies. The +1/+0 changes only
# power (the toughness stays 2) and ends with the turn (CR 514.2). The second target must be one Bot1 doesn't control: its other Ornithopter is refused.

